{
  "_comment": [
    "Cursor TRUSTED-OPERATOR Graphiti MCP shape \u2014 local SSH tunnel only.",
    "Front door: graphiti-memory @ 127.0.0.1:8100 via the operator's SSH tunnel.",
    "The bearer here is a local-tunnel credential on a trusted-operator surface,",
    "read from ~/.cursor/graphiti.env. It is NOT the retired cloud side door.",
    "",
    "This file is NOT the shape for agent adapters and never was authoritative",
    "for Claude Code. Model-controlled surfaces hold no credential: they point at",
    "${GRAPHITI_MCP_URL} with no in-file bearer. See",
    "environment/agents/adapters/claude-code/mcp.template.json (canonical) and",
    "environment/agents/adapters/ADAPTER_CONTRACT.md. The capability broker",
    "(${L9_CAPABILITY_BROKER_URL}/mcp/graphiti) never shipped.",
    "Retired: l9-shared-memory @ https://memory.quantumaipartners.com (HTTP side door)."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "graphiti-memory": {
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8100/mcp/",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer ${GRAPHITI_MCP_TOKEN}"
      }
    }
  }
}
